WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.840
A rough prompt often names the problem and
leaves out what a useful check would look like.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:11.140
Here a scripted rewrite adds a
command to reproduce the bug.

3
00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:17.000
Prompt coach checks whether the intent survived
and puts the rewritten request in your editor.

4
00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:28.071
Read the draft before sending it.

5
00:00:28.071 --> 00:00:33.073
You can keep the details that help and
change anything that strays from the task.
